{"task_id": "Mbpp/82", "solution": "import math\nfrom typing import Union\n\ndef volume_sphere(radius: Union[int, float]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Compute sphere volume using (4.0/3.0) * PI * radius**3 and return float.\"\"\"\n    r = float(radius)\n    vol = (4.0 / 3.0) * math.pi * (r ** 3)\n    return float(vol)"}
